## Definition of Done

**INSTRUCTION:** Copy all Definition of Done items from the Notion task. Mark each item as completed [x]. This demonstrates that all acceptance criteria were met.

**FORMAT:** Checklist with all items marked as complete

**EXAMPLE:**

```markdown
- [x] `Velocity.cs` created with `float3 Value` field
- [x] `Lifetime.cs` created with `double SpawnTime` and `float Duration` fields
- [x] `SpellOwner.cs` created with `Entity OwnerEntity` field
- [x] All components implement `IComponentData`
- [x] XML documentation added to all components
- [x] Components compile without errors or warnings
- [x] Folder structure `Assets/Scripts/Components/Common/` created
- [x] All files follow PascalCase naming conventions
- [x] Tested in Unity Entity Inspector
- [x] Performance verified (<0.5ms for 100 entities)
```

---

## 🔑 Key Technical Decisions

**INSTRUCTION:** List 3-5 most important technical decisions made during implementation. Include WHY each decision was made (rationale).

**FORMAT:**

```
1. **[Decision]** → [Rationale]
2. **[Decision]** → [Rationale]
3. **[Decision]** → [Rationale]
```

**EXAMPLE:**

```markdown
1. **`float3` instead of `Vector3`** → Burst-compatible and blittable
2. **`double` for SpawnTime** → Prevents accumulation errors in long sessions
3. **Lifetime uses absolute timestamp** → Cheaper than per-frame decrement
4. **SpellOwner uses `Entity` type** → Type-safe and allows direct queries
5. **`Common/` folder** → Clear organization for shared components
```

---

## 🔗 References

**INSTRUCTION:** Provide links to Notion task, parent story, and relevant documentation. Always include at minimum the task and story links.

**FORMAT:**

```
- **Notion Task:** [SPWT-X](notion_url)
- **Story:** [SPWS-X - Story Name](notion_url)
- **Documentation:** [file_path or external_url]
- **[Optional Category]:** [description](url)
```

**EXAMPLE:**

```markdown
- **Notion Task:** [SPWT-1](https://www.notion.so/28f56d55129b80679d4cd8ccd971713e)
- **Story:** [SPWS-1 - Spell Data Architecture & Foundation](https://www.notion.so/28f56d55129b8021b9edc9556533eb0d)
- **Documentation:** `.cursor/rules/concept/dots-architecture.mdc`
- **Unity Docs:** [IComponentData](https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.entities@latest/manual/components-unmanaged.html)
```

---

## Notes

**INSTRUCTION:** Add any additional context, known limitations, follow-up work, or important information reviewers should know. If nothing special to note, include a brief summary.

**FORMAT:** Free-form text, 1-3 sentences or bullet points

**EXAMPLE:**

```markdown
These components are prerequisites for all other spell functionality. They unblock parallel development of generators, modifiers, and payloads.
```

**EXAMPLE - With Limitations:**

```markdown
Current implementation does not support dynamic lifetime extension. This is intentional for MVP and will be addressed in SPWT-67 if needed.
```

````

