## Template Quality Checks

Before using this template, verify:

- [ ] Task ID (SPWT-X) and Story (SPWS-X) are correct
- [ ] Appropriate task-type section selected (Feature/Tech/Bug)
- [ ] "What Changed" provides clear high-level summary
- [ ] Files section accurately lists all changes
- [ ] All Definition of Done items copied and marked complete
- [ ] 3-5 Key Technical Decisions with rationale
- [ ] References include task, story, and relevant docs
- [ ] Notes provide additional context if needed
- [ ] All INSTRUCTION/FORMAT/EXAMPLE labels removed
- [ ] Markdown formatting is correct
- [ ] All emoticons preserved

---

